Rule 4 (for a scalar input tensor, minimum and maximum values must be equal)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 0 then min(v_1) = max(v_1)
>>
Rule 5 (minimum value of input tensor must not exceed its maximum value)
{v_1 : tensor} |= min(v_1) ≤ max(v_1)
>>
Rule 6 (unsigned 8-bit integer tensor elements must not exceed 255)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 5 then max(v_1) ≤ 255
